Error: Authentication failed. Your token is invalid, expired, or missing.
  Code: invalid_token (HTTP 401)
  Details: Token expired

Suggestions:
  - Run 'raps auth login' to re-authenticate
  - Check that your client credentials are correct
  - Verify RAPS_CLIENT_ID and RAPS_CLIENT_SECRET environment variables
